<del></del></span> Best Survival Hunter Trinkets in Phase 3</span></h2>DPS trinkets for Survival Hunters in Mists of Pandaria Classic require careful consideration of our rotation and ability cooldowns. Unlike some classes, Survival Hunters benefit significantly from trinket procs that align with our key abilities. The timing of trinket procs can dramatically impact our damage output, especially when they coincide with our cooldown windows.<h5 class="heading-size-5" id="best-trinkets">Best Trinkets</h5>Survival Hunters should generally use two passive trinkets in Phase 3, as they provide more consistent damage output and better synergy with our rotation. The best passive trinkets are <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=96369/renatakis-soul-charm">
<img alt="Renataki's Soul Charm" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_warrior_bladestorm.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Renataki's Soul Charm</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=96409/bad-juju">
<img alt="Bad Juju" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology_troll_voodoodoll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bad Juju</span></a>, almost without question.<br/>
<br/>
<ins>Passive Trinkets</ins>
<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=96369/renatakis-soul-charm">
<img alt="Renataki's Soul Charm" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_warrior_bladestorm.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Renataki's Soul Charm</span></a> is the strongest trinket available to us in Phase 3. It provides an extremely high damage bonus through its high Agility procs.</div></li></ul>
<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=96409/bad-juju">
<img alt="Bad Juju" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology_troll_voodoodoll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bad Juju</span></a> is our second best trinket, it has very consistent uptime of a lot of extra Agility, and it simply blows any options out of the park entirely.</div></li></ul>
