<img alt="Rune of Re-Origination" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_offhand_1h_ulduarraid_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rune of Re-Origination</span></a> is our third best trinket in Phase 3, and falls behind the other two options due to Agility being too powerful for us.</div></li></ul>
