<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="upgrades">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c1" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/pvecurrency-valor.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Items to Upgrade for Survival Hunters</span></h2>In Phase 3 you can upgrade items that aren't tier or Thunderforged by up to 8 item levels in exchange for <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a> or <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> for PvE gear, and <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=1901/honor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Honor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvpcurrency-honor-horde.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Honor Points</span></span></a> or <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=390/conquest-points">
<span>
<img alt="Conquest Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvpcurrency-conquest-horde.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conquest Points</span></span></a> for PvP gear. Upgrading Heroic items from Throne of Thunder makes them equal in item level to if the item had been Thunderforged, this means that you want to upgrade all your best in slot items as soon as possible.<br/>
<br/>When upgrading gear, you should generally focus on your weapon first, then any trinkets and finally chest, legs and shoulders.<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="reputation">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c3" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_faction_shadopan_assault.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Reputation for Survival Hunters in Phase 3</span></h2>Reputation gear can be very strong, but it can also be difficult to choose which factions to prioritize first. Focus on starting to gain reputation with Shado-Pan assault as soon as possible so that you can get an early <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95143/flankers-battletags">
<img alt="Flanker's Battletags" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_133.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Flanker's Battletags</span></a>. As for what to get after that, it will depend on what items you've had drop from the raid. I would suggest simming your own optimal upgrade path for these valor items as they are costly..<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="shado-pan-assault">
